{"channelId":"UCeTPNlUNAuSeF7sDKoTFRaQ","row":["Cavalcade Education",73,"Cavalcade Education is run by equine veterinarians to improve equine health through education for professionals, horse owners, and students.\n\nWe help veterinarians stay at the top of their game with cutting-edge training that blends research with real-world skills. For horse owners, we offer classes that make it easier to care for their horses and keep them healthy.\n\nFor future equine vets, we provide hands-on learning, networking, and courses to build confidence and expertise.\n\nWith over 10 years of experience, Cavalcade Education is here to support the equine community every step of the way.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeTPNlUNAuSeF7sDKoTFRaQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeTPNlUNAuSeF7sDKoTFRaQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:35.665Z","channelId":"UCeTPNlUNAuSeF7sDKoTFRaQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"b3d040a19dccc1fff2fffe80378d2cd4ea66569f54d58915850cbd34faaa90aa","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"26c2217774aa05f04db516742a61f4171d092ddb235641ed29562f645e22c75a"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeTPNlUNAuSeF7sDKoTFRaQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:35.665Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeTPNlUNAuSeF7sDKoTFRaQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":73,"raw":"73 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCeTPNlUNAuSeF7sDKoTFRaQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:35.665Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["veterinary"],"relevantKeywords":["veterinary"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinarian","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；